T:Jesus, Keep Me Near the Cross
T:NEAR THE CROSS
C:Music: William H. Doane, 1869 · Words: Fanny J. Crosby, 1869
S:hymnary.org score (hymnary.org/text/jesus_keep_me_near_the_cross; hymnary.org/media/fetch/87948), melody line with all stanzas printed there; first published before 1931 (US public domain). Melody compared with 2 other hymnary.org editions: 100% of pitches agree. Words checked by hand against the standard text; modernized wording was put back to the original.
