w: Je- sus, keep me near the cross, There a pre- cious foun- tain—
w: Near the cross, a trem- bling soul, Love and Mer- cy found me;
w: Near the cross! O Lamb of God, Bring its scenes be- fore me;
w: Near the cross I’ll watch and wait Hop- ing, trust- ing ev- er,
